reference-relationships-rule-language = Rules act on relationships within this library and keep or reverse existing endpoints. Conditions and copied values always read the original manual relationship. Rules with the same root type and output type must use the same metadata mapping, including disabled rules. Scripts and new endpoint discovery are unsupported. Preview reviews the complete effects; changes that exceed the rule evaluation limit are rejected.
reference-relationships-rule-reset = Changing the root or output type resets dependent conditions and mappings. Select them explicitly before reviewing again.
reference-relationships-rule-read-only = This library is read-only. Rules can be inspected but cannot be changed.
reference-relationships-rule-empty = No rules in this library. New rules take effect only after preview and Save.
